<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="uz">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Milliy Taomlar</title>

<style>
body{
    margin:0;
    font-family:Arial,sans-serif;
    background:#f8f8f8;
}

header{
    background:#8B0000;
    color:white;
    text-align:center;
    padding:40px;
}

nav{
    background:#222;
    padding:15px;
    text-align:center;
}

nav a{
    color:white;
    text-decoration:none;
    margin:20px;
    font-size:18px;
}

section{
    width:85%;
    margin:20px auto;
    background:white;
    padding:20px;
    border-radius:10px;
}

.menu{
    display:flex;
    justify-content:space-around;
    flex-wrap:wrap;
}

.item{
    width:250px;
    background:#f2f2f2;
    margin:15px;
    padding:15px;
    border-radius:10px;
    text-align:center;
}

button{
    background:#8B0000;
    color:white;
    border:none;
    padding:10px 20px;
    cursor:pointer;
}

footer{
    background:#222;
    color:white;
    text-align:center;
    padding:20px;
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
<h1>Milliy Taomlar Restorani</h1>
<p>Eng mazali o'zbek milliy taomlari</p>
</header>

<nav>
<a href="#">Bosh sahifa</a>
<a href="#">Menyu</a>
<a href="#">Buyurtma</a>
<a href="#">Aloqa</a>
</nav>

<section>
<h2>Biz haqimizda</h2>
<p>
Bizning restoranimizda palov, shashlik, somsa,
manti va boshqa milliy taomlar tayyorlanadi.
</p>
</section>

<section>
<h2>Menyu</h2>

<div class="menu">

<div class="item">
<h3>Palov</h3>
<p>Narxi: 35 000 so'm</p>
<button>Buyurtma</button>
</div>

<div class="item">
<h3>Shashlik</h3>
<p>Narxi: 18 000 so'm</p>
<button>Buyurtma</button>
</div>

<div class="item">
<h3>Manti</h3>
<p>Narxi: 30 000 so'm</p>
<button>Buyurtma</button>
</div>

<div class="item">
<h3>Somsa</h3>
<p>Narxi: 8 000 so'm</p>
<button>Buyurtma</button>
</div>

</div>

</section>

<section>
<h2>Buyurtma berish</h2>

<form>
<label>Ism:</label><br>
<input type="text"><br><br>

<label>Telefon:</label><br>
<input type="tel"><br><br>

<label>Taom:</label><br>

<select>
<option>Palov</option>
<option>Shashlik</option>
<option>Manti</option>
<option>Somsa</option>
</select>

<br><br>

<button>Yuborish</button>

</form>

</section>

<footer>
<p>© 2026 Milliy Taomlar Restorani</p>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
